  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environment.seminars SPB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Milj&#xF6;dagar i SPB 300 &#xE5;r</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I samband med Sankt Petersburgs 300-&#xE5;rsjubileum kommer Sverige att fokusera p&#xE5; framg&#xE5;ngsrika milj&#xF6;aktiviteter i Ryssland, finansierade av Sida och UD, p&#xE5; hotell &quot;Pulkovskaja&quot;, 2-4 september 2003, d&#xE5; seminarier, workshops och &quot;match-making&quot; aktiviteter kommer att ske, koordinerade av SweHeat och Associationen f&#xF6;r koordinering med Nordeuropas l&#xE4;nder &quot;Norden&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In connection with St.Petersburg&apos;s 300th anniversary, Sweden will focus on successful environmental activities in Russia, financed by Sida and the Ministry for Foreign Affairs, at Hotel &quot;Pulkovskaya&quot;, 2-4 September 2003 where seminars, workshops and match-making acti- vities will be carried out, co-ordinated by SweHeat and Association for co-operation with the countries of Northern Europe &quot;Norden&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
